00:16:22.115 --> 00:16:25.518
It is truly a shame that things have come to this.

00:16:25.518 --> 00:16:26.416
Farewell.

00:16:45.271 --> 00:16:46.397
Big Bro!

00:16:47.674 --> 00:16:49.801
Big Bro, you'll be okay, won't you?

00:16:50.110 --> 00:16:52.340
I believe that you'll come back!

00:16:53.680 --> 00:16:54.704
Nanako...

00:16:55.815 --> 00:16:57.942
You really looked out for me, didn't you?

00:16:59.452 --> 00:17:00.817
Don't lose, Narukami!

00:17:13.500 --> 00:17:16.867
I actually count on you quite a lot.

00:17:27.080 --> 00:17:29.310
Thanks to you, I feel better.

00:17:43.430 --> 00:17:44.898
He read my next move?!

00:17:44.898 --> 00:17:46.627
Master, thank you!

00:17:58.344 --> 00:18:01.438
You taught me something important.

00:18:08.588 --> 00:18:11.352
I am sure you will be all right.

00:18:20.100 --> 00:18:22.500
You have to be, even if we're apart.

00:18:39.285 --> 00:18:41.412
Senpai, I believe in you.

00:19:15.989 --> 00:19:18.787
You've saved me in more ways
than one, haven't you?

00:19:20.260 --> 00:19:23.252
I was supposed to take care of you,
but you took care of me.

00:19:23.796 --> 00:19:26.924
That may be precisely
how we were able to pull it off.

00:19:27.834 --> 00:19:30.268
It's how we became a true family.

00:19:34.607 --> 00:19:35.631
That's!

00:19:38.111 --> 00:19:40.713
I was nervous about facing
tomorrow without everyone.

00:19:40.713 --> 00:19:44.884
I was afraid of losing my friends
and pushing forward all on my own.

00:19:44.884 --> 00:19:47.020
I don't want to be alone ever again.

00:19:47.020 --> 00:19:49.454
I've had enough of being alone!

00:19:49.556 --> 00:19:50.523
Yeah...

00:19:51.224 --> 00:19:52.282
I have!

00:19:56.029 --> 00:19:57.656
This will be my last one!

00:20:06.773 --> 00:20:09.008
I wanted to stay with everyone forever.

00:20:09.008 --> 00:20:12.034
Even if that meant being with
fake versions of them in the fog!

00:20:12.378 --> 00:20:17.111
I don't want to return to a life where
I don't share bonds with anyone!

00:20:17.550 --> 00:20:21.077
As long as I'm with everyone, I'm cool.

00:20:21.854 --> 00:20:24.448
Yeah, I don't need the truth!

00:20:24.591 --> 00:20:27.458
Even if they were just illusions,
I wanted to be with everyone.

00:20:28.027 --> 00:20:29.551
That is how I felt.

00:20:30.697 --> 00:20:33.165
You are me, aren't you?

00:20:43.209 --> 00:20:45.143
I'm no longer alone!

00:21:03.529 --> 00:21:05.827
Even if you should lose everything,

00:21:06.132 --> 00:21:10.000
solitude will never again visit your soul.

00:21:12.739 --> 00:21:15.537
Never forget that.

00:21:21.447 --> 00:21:26.248
This is a crystal of the power
you nurtured throughout your journey.

00:21:26.486 --> 00:21:33.392
This orb whisks away false pretenses
and dispels lies as it illuminates the truth.

00:21:39.432 --> 00:21:40.797
Thank you.

00:21:49.976 --> 00:21:50.908
Hm?

00:21:52.779 --> 00:21:55.247
Why did you come back?

00:21:55.815 --> 00:21:58.443
Is that your true form?

00:21:58.918 --> 00:22:00.620
But it changes nothing.

00:22:00.620 --> 00:22:05.284
The consensus of the people will drag you
into the abyss as many times as needed.

00:22:10.129 --> 00:22:10.959
What's this?

00:22:12.198 --> 00:22:13.460
That's impossible!

00:22:13.833 --> 00:22:17.269
Can an individual's will surpass
the consensus of the masses?

00:22:28.114 --> 00:22:30.947
Why? Why do you move forward?

00:22:31.517 --> 00:22:34.187
You would be happier if you only saw
what you wanted to see within the fog

00:22:34.187 --> 00:22:37.748
and immersed yourself in a world
that matches your desires.

00:22:37.990 --> 00:22:40.059
It isn't your place...

00:22:40.059 --> 00:22:41.822
...to decide what happiness is!

00:22:49.836 --> 00:22:53.363
Your friends no longer exist in this world.

00:22:53.673 --> 00:22:56.369
Do you mean to say
you will live alone in solitude?

00:22:56.676 --> 00:22:59.042
I'm not alone!

00:23:07.887 --> 00:23:13.883
How dare a human, who cannot see through
the fog without that little toy, speak of truth?

00:23:15.228 --> 00:23:16.889
Then I'll show you...

00:23:17.397 --> 00:23:18.989
...a human's potential!

00:23:42.522 --> 00:23:44.353
Do you think yourself a god?!

00:23:55.201 --> 00:23:56.395
Impossible!

00:23:59.806 --> 00:24:04.644
Anyone who opens their eyes and
looks ahead can see it...

00:24:04.644 --> 00:24:05.508
...the truth!

00:24:07.313 --> 00:24:10.942
I will clear away all of the fog that inhibits them!

00:24:12.985 --> 00:24:16.421
I believe in the countless number
of truths that exist beyond that!

00:24:25.998 --> 00:24:28.023
The countless number of truths?

00:24:28.334 --> 00:24:35.240
I see... You have cleared away the fog
in both this world and the real world.

00:24:35.441 --> 00:24:41.937
This time, I shall observe from on high as to
whether this will in fact lead to happiness.

00:24:42.415 --> 00:24:44.315
Yeah, please watch and see.

00:24:45.952 --> 00:24:47.715
Human child...

00:24:48.855 --> 00:24:50.584
You have done well!

00:24:57.296 --> 00:24:58.263
Where is this?

00:24:58.664 --> 00:25:00.598
Is this the TV world?

00:25:01.534 --> 00:25:04.731
So this is how that world originally looked...

00:25:06.572 --> 00:25:08.437
Magnificent!

00:25:08.508 --> 00:25:14.504
You had a truly meaningful journey
for one of your age.

00:25:14.981 --> 00:25:19.975
Now that all of the fog has cleared,
there is nothing left to lead you astray.

00:25:20.119 --> 00:25:24.021
Please follow your heart as it takes
you down your own path.

00:25:24.190 --> 00:25:30.288
I am afraid this shall be my last time
inviting you here like this.

00:25:33.132 --> 00:25:34.827
Huh? But wasn't I?

00:25:37.537 --> 00:25:38.871
Where is this?!

00:25:38.871 --> 00:25:39.803
It's beautiful...

00:25:41.307 --> 00:25:42.296
Guys!

00:25:44.010 --> 00:25:45.044
What's going on?

00:25:45.044 --> 00:25:48.147
I beary much recognize this scenery!

00:25:48.147 --> 00:25:52.518
My world used to be like this
a long, long time ago!

00:25:52.518 --> 00:25:53.815
Punk! That was dangerous.

00:25:54.987 --> 00:25:55.976
Senpai!

00:25:56.856 --> 00:25:58.153
Narukami!

00:25:58.324 --> 00:25:59.348
Yu!

00:26:00.960 --> 00:26:01.494
Yay!

00:26:01.494 --> 00:26:02.483
Senpai!
Yay!

00:26:10.169 --> 00:26:13.072
At long last, the contract has been fulfilled.

00:26:13.072 --> 00:26:15.973
My job is now done.

00:26:16.242 --> 00:26:19.734
You were a superb guest.

00:26:21.581 --> 00:26:24.016
Now, be off with you.

00:26:24.016 --> 00:26:27.679
And behold with your own two eyes.

00:26:28.854 --> 00:26:36.317
See how wondrous the future is
in the world you ultimately won.

00:26:50.810 --> 00:26:52.869
Well, see ya around.

00:26:53.145 --> 00:26:54.874
Do your best over there, too.

00:26:55.147 --> 00:26:57.672
I'll come running if anything happens.

00:26:58.050 --> 00:27:00.541
Let's meet again. It's a must!

00:27:01.053 --> 00:27:03.222
Senpai, I'll be waitin' for ya!

00:27:03.222 --> 00:27:05.091
See you, Senpai.

00:27:05.091 --> 00:27:07.226
I look forward to seeing you again.

00:27:07.226 --> 00:27:08.921
Take care.

00:27:09.929 --> 00:27:13.194
See you later, Big Bro. Bye-bye!

00:27:13.799 --> 00:27:16.893
Yeah! Guys, take care.

